LOCAL INSTALLATION
------------------

This version of the package installs Microsoft TrueType core fonts directly 
from a local directory provided during the package build (msfonts/). The files 
are natively compiled into the dpkg payload via debhelper.

These fonts are sourced from a modern Windows 11 installation, providing a 
more comprehensive and updated set than the original web core fonts.

The fonts are placed natively in /usr/share/fonts/truetype/msttcorefonts 
upon installation of the package. No network download or post-installation 
scripting is required.

LIBERATION FONTS
----------------

The package fonts-liberation contains free variants of the Times,
Arial and Courier fonts. We recommend to use that instead unless you
specifically need one of the other fonts from this package.

